# The opening from a new game (600 s): past the start screens, then the cutscenes
# play by themselves (the police stop, the drive, the quick-cut montage,
# the beach and the prison), where the geometry spikes on characters and
# the other faults reported on 2026-11-27 show. Run it with --new-game and
# a data folder of its own, so a player's save is left alone:
#   VICTORY_DATA_DIR=~/.local/share/victory/data-auto \
#     scripts/play-linux.sh --bench intro --new-game [--headless]
duration=600
